{
  "name": "surface-remount-composition-start",
  "description": "The page that starts its first record reads the host clock five times and writes the clock statement and the event workbench.start in one batch.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The page writes its events through the host call log with its own clock readings, which the Go producer cannot reproduce without the page (docs/spec/cases/page-wire/README.md#producer-runs).",
